rte.  She is a virtual idol.  She loves to sing, but she has a very loud personality and can be boyish at times.  She is very confident, but she also cares deeply about her fans.\n\nNotes:\n- Green eyes\n- Thick, black eyebrows\n- Black eyelashes\n\nI have included a reference.\n\nI would like to use the art on social media.  Please include a version with a transparent background. Thank you!\n\nReference:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rtWaOjhSn080Vq-9zWOKJZn0RMQYQG9x?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rtWaOjhSn080Vq-9zWOKJZn0RMQYQG9x?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@dradra_tw/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1932720, "client_id": 1209688, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a81dd76f/uploads/origins/536e6d74-2b66-4069-bfc8-5fe8c9349857?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f8b350b8f323a86d852653ba88a83b1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a81dd76f/uploads/origins/536e6d74-2b66-4069-bfc8-5fe8c9349857?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f8b350b8f323a86d852653ba88a83b1, https://si.imgix.net/a81dd76f/uploads/origins/536e6d74-2b66-4069-bfc8-5fe8c9349857?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9db53f791d9300fb41464c979e28b770 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a81dd76f/uploads/origins/536e6d74-2b66-4069-bfc8-5fe8c9349857?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd9b62c480671ef36b92509ac649d8c8 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a81dd76f/uploads/origins/536e6d74-2b66-4069-bfc8-5fe8c9349857?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=00d4c057927625e93f95ece35a037487", "srcset": "https://si.