tuber Chisaka Airi\n\nLooking to get a drawing of her in an angel halloween costume in your style.\n\nThe art may be used on Youtube, Twitch, and other SNS platforms for thumbnails.\n\nPlease have fun with the request and change or add details as you see fit.\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/WdfnDv6h.jpg", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@dradra_tw/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1932720, "client_id": 1869278, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/863d40ca/uploads/origins/7789685a-c31b-4e45-ae08-abb0be8d940a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ce5d2f0338312e94493c00fc10f0987", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/863d40ca/uploads/origins/7789685a-c31b-4e45-ae08-abb0be8d940a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ce5d2f0338312e94493c00fc10f0987, https://si.imgix.net/863d40ca/uploads/origins/7789685a-c31b-4e45-ae08-abb0be8d940a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=43dbc185c01c36af029d585f92e5e02e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/863d40ca/uploads/origins/7789685a-c31b-4e45-ae08-abb0be8d940a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f849eba4c26b42b4943b58571a015872 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/863d40ca/uploads/origins/7789685a-c31b-4e45-ae08-abb0be8d940a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=18e468778d54314f38f69d094920c959", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/863d40ca/uploads/origins/7789685a-c31b-4e45-ae08-abb0be8d940a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=18e468778d54314f38f69d094920c959, https://si.imgix.net/863d40ca/uploads/origins/7789685a-c31b-4e45-ae08-abb0be8d940a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f993ff8ba5428d3d5931c9a4ff811209 2x, https://si.imgix.net/863d40ca/uploads/origins/7789685a-c31b-4e45-ae08-abb0be8d940a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f2e8520b2470be86026cfbdf9bfd6172 3x"}, "body": "Hi, I love your art style! I would like to request art of two OCs if you don't mind. :)\n\nIf possible, I'd like you to draw me and my vtuber brother smiling with our heads leaning on eachother and our thumbs up (\ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udffb) to congratulate him for his 100 day anniversary of streaming !!\n\nI will leave the dimensions and overall composition up to you. :>\n\nMy vtuber brother: https://twitter.com/monggun0901?t=hgscKXru8R2RArLaw1cUmg&s=09\n\nMe/Myself: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1fWRqdZFkUAIFkCda_Gp2etcsWCfx6UxY?usp=sharing\n\nThank you so much! :)", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@dradra_tw/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1932720, "client_id": 1443286, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/30b4a7d2/uploads/origins/d4b9770a-ec6e-4cbb-99a5-77b515801527?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a16888bafbf3674419a82aeddd1787fe", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/30b4a7d2/uploads/origins/d4b9770a-ec6e-4cbb-99a5-77b515801527?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a16888bafbf3674419a82aeddd1787fe, https://si.imgix.net/30b4a7d2/uploads/origins/d4b9770a-ec6e-4cbb-99a5-77b515801527?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b20d18b4af7413705646f6e6bec5ade 2x, https://si.imgix.net/30b4a7d2/uploads/origins/d4b9770a-ec6e-4cbb-99a5-77b515801527?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df5abfc97533a049d0d9ac10d78ceb6